n></p><p><span>   专业名称：电气工程</span></p><p><span>   学位类型：学术学位</span></p><p><span><span>2.专业代码：080900</span></span></p><p><span>   专业名称：电子科学与技术</span></p><p><span>   学位类型：学术学位</span></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>直博生</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.专业代码：080800</span></span></p><p><span>   专业名称：电气工程</span></p><p><span>   学位类型：学术学位</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1．具有所在学校推荐免试资格的2027届优秀本科毕业生，在校期间学习成绩优秀，有较强的专业创新意识和创新能力。</span></p><p><span>2．拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好、遵纪守法、诚实守信、恪守学术规范。</span></p><p><span>3．身心健康，身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span><span>4．申请直博生的学生，除满足以上条件外，需具有博士生培养潜质。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>（一）预报名的同学：</span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><strong><span><span>9月8日—9月16日</span></span></strong><span>，申请人进入“长沙理工大学接受推荐免试研究生网上申请系统”（简称“申请系统”，</span><strong><span><span>网址</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：https</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>://yjszs.csust.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>edu.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>cn/</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>zsgl/tmsgl/default.aspx</span></span></strong><span>）,先申请报名编号，再填写申请提交。各学院对推免生的预报名信息进行初审，具体安排以各学院的通知为准。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><strong><span><span>9月21日</span></span></strong><span>（具体开通时间以教育部开通的时间为准），推免生登录教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，</span><strong><span><span>网址：http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span></strong><span>）进行注册，填写基本信息，上传照片，网上报名。按照预报名拟接收的专业填报志愿。届时，我校将在推免服务系统中发放复试通知和拟录取通知，</span><strong><span><span>推免生应在规定的时间内按要求接受并确认，否则视为自动放弃。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（二）未预报名的同学</span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>9月21日</span></span></strong><span>，推免生登录推免服务系统进行报名。我校分批审核申请信息，实行先申请先审核的原则，择优选拔。申请人名单经学院审核后，学院通过推免服务系统向符合条件的申请人发送复试通知。收到复试通知后，</span><strong><span><span>申请人应及时登录推免服务系统进行确认，并及时与报考学院研究生办公室联系。</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名材料及详细要求</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>具体报名要求、申请材料、复试和录取等相关事项，请查看《长沙理工大学招收2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）招生简章》，具体网址为：</span><strong><span><span>https://www.csust.edu.cn/yjsy/info/1116/11804.htm</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p><